//// set: en-t5 — 类型维数组在别的语境：der / when / reinit / if、数组运算、函数实参、子实例 / 记录字段、属性、Boolean 运行时下标
//// model: T50
model T50
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E](each start = 0);
equation
  for i in E loop der(y[i]) = a; end for;
end T50;
//// model: T51
model T51
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E](start = {1, 2, 3});
equation
  der(y) = {a, a, a};
end T51;
//// model: T52
model T52
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E](start = {1, 2, 3}, each fixed = true);
equation
  der(y[E.one]) = a; der(y[E.two]) = y[E.one]; der(y[E.three]) = y[E.two];
end T52;
//// model: T53
model T53
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  discrete Real d[E](each start = 0);
equation
  when a > 1 then d[E.one] = pre(d[E.one]) + 1; d[E.two] = 0; d[E.three] = pre(d[E.two]); end when;
end T53;
//// model: T54
model T54
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  discrete Real d[Boolean](each start = 0);
equation
  when a > 1 then d[true] = pre(d[false]) + 1; d[false] = 0; end when;
end T54;
//// model: T55
model T55
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E](each start = 0);
equation
  for i in E loop der(y[i]) = a; end for; when a > 1 then reinit(y[E.two], 0); end when;
end T55;
//// model: T56
model T56
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E];
equation
  if a > 1 then y = {a, 1, 2}; else y = {0, 0, 0}; end if;
end T56;
//// model: T57
model T57
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E];
equation
  for i in E loop if i == E.one then y[i] = a; else y[i] = 0; end if; end for;
end T57;
//// model: T58
model T58
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z = if y[E.one] > 1 then y[E.two] else y[E.three];
end T58;
//// model: T59
model T59
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z = min(y) + max(y) + product(y);
end T59;
//// model: T510
model T510
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z[E] = y .* y + y;
end T510;
//// model: T511
model T511
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z = y * y;
end T511;
//// model: T512
model T512
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z[3] = -y;
end T512;
//// model: T513
model T513
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z[2, 3] = {y, y};
end T513;
//// model: T514
model T514
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z[6] = cat(1, y, y);
end T514;
//// model: T515
model T515
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z[3] = sin(y);
end T515;
//// model: T516
model T516
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E, E] = {{a, 1, 2}, {3, 4, 5}, {6, 7, 8}}; Real z[E, E] = transpose(y);
end T516;
//// model: T517
model T517
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E, E] = {{a, 1, 2}, {3, 4, 5}, {6, 7, 8}}; Real z[3, 3] = y * y;
end T517;
//// model: T518
model T518
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E, E] = {{a, 1, 2}, {3, 4, 5}, {6, 7, 8}}; Real z = y[E.two, E.three];
end T518;
//// model: T519
model T519
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  function f input Real u[3]; output Real s; algorithm s := u[1] + u[2] + u[3]; end f; Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z = f(y);
end T519;
//// model: T520
model T520
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  function f input Real u[:]; output Real s; algorithm s := sum(u); end f; Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z = f(y);
end T520;
//// model: T521
model T521
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  function f input Real u[E]; output Real s; algorithm s := u[E.one]; end f; Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z = f(y);
end T521;
//// model: T522
model T522
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  function f input Real u; output Real s; algorithm s := u * 2; end f; Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z = f(y[E.two]);
end T522;
//// model: T523
model T523
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  model M Real y[E] = {time, 1, 2}; end M; M m; Real z = m.y[E.two] + sum(m.y);
end T523;
//// model: T524
model T524
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  model M Real y[E]; end M; M m;
equation
  for i in E loop m.y[i] = a; end for;
end T524;
//// model: T525
model T525
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  model M parameter Real p[E] = {1, 2, 3}; end M; M m(p = {4, 5, 6}); Real z = m.p[E.three] * a;
end T525;
//// model: T526
model T526
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  model M parameter Real p[E] = {1, 2, 3}; end M; M m(p(each start = 1)); Real z = m.p[E.three] * a;
end T526;
//// model: T527
model T527
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  record R Real y[E]; end R; R r;
equation
  r.y = {a, 1, 2};
end T527;
//// model: T528
model T528
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  record R Real y[E]; end R; R r;
equation
  for i in E loop r.y[i] = a; end for;
end T528;
//// model: T529
model T529
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  record R Real y[E]; end R; R r(y = {a, 1, 2}); Real z = r.y[E.two];
end T529;
//// model: T530
model T530
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  model M Real y[E] = {time, 1, 2}; end M; M m[2]; Real z = m[1].y[E.two] + m[2].y[E.three];
end T530;
//// model: T531
model T531
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  connector C Real v[E]; flow Real f[E]; end C; C c1; C c2;
equation
  connect(c1, c2); c1.v = {a, 1, 2};
end T531;
//// model: T532
model T532
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z;
equation
  z = y[E.one]; assert(y[E.two] > 0, "y " + String(y[E.three]));
end T532;
//// model: T533
model T533
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z; algorithm z := y[E.one]; assert(y[E.two] > 0, "y");
end T533;
//// model: T534
model T534
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E]; algorithm y[E.one] := a; y[E.two] := 1; y[E.three] := 2;
end T534;
//// model: T535
model T535
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E]; algorithm y := {a, 1, 2};
end T535;
//// model: T536
model T536
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E]; Real z[E] = {a, 1, 2}; algorithm y := z; y[E.one] := y[E.one] + 1;
end T536;
//// model: T537
model T537
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z[size(y, 1)] = y; Integer n = size(y, 1);
end T537;
//// model: T538
model T538
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Boolean b = y[E.one] > y[E.two]; Integer k = if b then 1 else 2;
end T538;
//// model: T539
model T539
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  parameter Integer k[E] = {1, 2, 3}; Real y[3] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z = y[k[E.two]];
end T539;
//// model: T540
model T540
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  parameter Integer k[E] = {1, 2, 3}; Real z[k[E.two]];
end T540;
//// model: T541
model T541
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  constant Integer k[E] = {1, 2, 3}; Real z[k[E.two]]; Real w = k[E.three] * a;
end T541;
//// model: T542
model T542
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  constant Integer k[E, 2] = {{1, 2}, {3, 4}, {5, 6}}; Real w = k[E.three, 2] * a; Real z[k[E.one, 2]];
end T542;
//// model: T543
model T543
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  type F = enumeration(u, v); Real y[E, F] = {{a, 1}, {2, 3}, {4, 5}}; Real z = y[E.two, F.v]; Real w[F] = y[E.three, :];
end T543;
//// model: T544
model T544
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  type F = enumeration(u, v); Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z = y[F.u];
end T544;
//// model: T545
model T545
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  type F = enumeration(u, v); Real y[E];
equation
  for i in F loop y[i] = a; end for;
end T545;
//// model: T546
model T546
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z = y[E.four];
end T546;
//// model: T547
model T547
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[E] = {a, 1, 2}; Real z = y[true];
end T547;
//// model: T548
model T548
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[Boolean] = {a, 1}; Real z = y[E.one];
end T548;
//// model: T549
model T549
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[Boolean] = {a, 1}; Real z = y[1];
end T549;
//// model: T550
model T550
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[Boolean] = {a, 1}; Real z = y[a > 1];
end T550;
//// model: T551
model T551
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  Real y[Boolean] = {a, 1}; Boolean c = a > 1; Real z = y[c];
end T551;
//// model: T552
model T552
  type E = enumeration(one, two, three);
  Real a = time;
  StateSelect ss[E] = {StateSelect.never, StateSelect.default, StateSelect.always}; Real y[StateSelect] = {a, 1, 2, 3, 4}; Real z = y[StateSelect.prefer];
end T552;
